  budget:
    enforcement: advisory
    maximum_memory_gb: 4
    maximum_workers: 1
    maximum_runs: 1
  stopping_rules:
  - One serial run:144 ordinary search executions,9 solver controls and12 references; no outcome-selected targets/scaling
    or automatic reruns.
  - PC caps degree2/256 admitted rows/512 calls; rows+1 attempted marker retained. PC exhaustion disables PC
    only; checked constant-inverse leaf fallback remains. Native20k decisions and20k conflicts per solve, at
    most2^(2s)+1 solves; budget None result is censored.
  - Child120s or global7200s watchdog retains partials; absent required final artifacts makes native aggregate
    incomplete/invalid, never negative mathematics. Controls must complete; censored A/A is inconclusive.
  invalidation_rules:
  - Wrong source/config/native ABI, invalid identity/model/reference, reference-guided search, missing/duplicate/unplanned
    row, changed callback/backend policy, false partial label, failed required control, complete A/A mismatch
    or omitted costs invalidates the affected observation.
  - A native-budget censored full-output row is retained and nondecisive; process timeout missing final artifacts
    prevents valid aggregate completion.
  success_criterion: 'C-SOUND and C-SEARCH: exact checks, all48 eligible pairs and at least one joint partial-proof/fewer-model-check
    signature. This is finite mechanism observation only.'
  falsification_criterion: 'C-SEARCH: no joint signature among all48 completed eligible pairs is negative only
    for this tested instrument. Any incomplete pair is inconclusive; an invalid certificate/reference fails
    C-SOUND.'
  decision_impact:
    on_positive: After independent review, separately admit a larger/held-out comparison against complementary-point
      baseline; no status promotion here.
    on_negative: Rerank this schedule/window below alternatives, preserving shared-coefficient and other search
      directions.
    on_inconclusive: Retain exact missing/censored/invalid records and diagnose before any additive replay.
  variable_ledger:
    independent: *id001
    factors:
    - name: public_inputs
      treatment: fixed
      how: Same frozen curve/digit/target rule and exact inputs within every matched comparison; all encodings
        retained.
    - name: encoding
      treatment: crossed
      how: All four encodings in every input; compare strategies within an encoding only.
    - name: theory_call_timing
      treatment: crossed
      how: Only candidate permits calls with assigned_count<n on eligible contiguous prefix.
    - name: backend_and_policy
      treatment: fixed
      how: Same installed native ABI, seed0, nonlazy callbacks, false-first lowest variable decision and external
        proof/projection clause delivery.
    - name: limits_and_cache
      treatment: fixed
      how: Same PC degree2/256row admission/512call caps; UNKNOWN caches once; checked full-leaf fallback.
        Native per-call decision/conflict caps fixed.
    - name: fresh_process_identity
      treatment: measured
      how: Every arm a fresh child process; A/A repeats identical candidate with a new slot/output identity.
    - name: order
      treatment: fixed
      how: Controls first; rotate strategy order by cell+encoding index modulo3; reference runs last.
    - name: accounting
      treatment: fixed
      how: Same named counter definitions and phase boundaries; no cross-unit pricing. Parent startup wall,
        callback serialization and fsync are not a complete counter model.
    - name: reference_visibility
      treatment: fixed
      how: Reference producer runs after all search/control rows; no oracle-dependent clauses or selection.
    - name: host_environment
      treatment: measured
      how: Native environment plus child ABI/Python fingerprint, host CPU/kernel/load/resource context; no
        timed primary metric.
    - name: analyst
      treatment: fixed
      how: Frozen unmasked extraction; independent review with protocol/source/raw access but no producer interpretation
        before independent recomputation.
    - name: preemption
      treatment: measured
      how: Partial journals preserved; no scientific resume/retry. Missing required final artifacts prevents
        native valid completion.
